OL,3,GNEWSAWe won't stop - family of abuse   
OL,4,Asurvivor with brain injury call for    
OL,5,Atougher sentences                      
OL,7,FJohn Gizzi, 55, from St Asaph,         
OL,8,FDenbighshire, was jailed for four years
OL,9,Fand 11 months at Mold Crown Court last 
OL,10,Fweek after the court heard he had      
OL,11,Fsubjected her to months of physical and
OL,12,Fverbal attacks and humiliations.       
